{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113450/extras/bc22986647692bfc13ddd7184a8ecbc4.poster.avif?t=1765960906\" width=620 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113450/extras/bc22986647692bfc13ddd7184a8ecbc4.webm?t=1765960906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113450/extras/bc22986647692bfc13ddd7184a8ecbc4.mp4?t=1765960906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Freedom &amp; Glory</strong> aims to combine adventure, multiple choices, and historical storytelling: <br><i>Rather than following a textbook script, Freedom &amp; Glory presents history as a dynamic, branching experience.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player takes on the role of a ship captain navigating through decisive historical moments, managing both crew and moral choices.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Mechanics &amp; Content</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative choices</strong>: multiple paths available depending on the player\u2019s decisions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quests and progression</strong>: version 0.1.4, as mentioned by the developers, includes <i>10\u201315 minutes of gameplay, 6 quests, and 3 secondary characters. A three-part story with multiple possible paths.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong>: auto-save system, customization (character/ship name), improved tutorial are listed in version 0.1.5.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Development state</strong>: the historical context and environment (ship, island, crew) are still under visual/technical development.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udccc Positioning &amp; Ambition</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game positions itself as <i>\u201ca unique interactive experience that blends: a deep narrative RPG where every dialogue and choice impacts your \u2026\u201d</i> according to its Ulule page.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The studio indicates its intention to go beyond traditional <i>\u201cedutainment\u201d</i>: a game that not only informs but truly immerses players in history.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2705 Strengths</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>rich narrative</strong> and <strong>multiple branching choices</strong> provide strong replayability (different paths depending on decisions).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>historical theme</strong> is quite rare in indie narrative games, which makes it stand out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Being developed by a <strong>French independent studio (Pillow Interactive)</strong> adds a handcrafted, authentic dimension.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4113450?t=1765960906","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4113450?t=1765960906","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113450/8c538dc394be3eec072c21ef8784ff0fe6ab931d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765960906","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113450/8c538dc394be3eec072c21ef8784ff0fe6ab931d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765960906","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4128900,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113450/extras/bc22986647692bfc13ddd7184a8ecbc4.poster.avif?t=1765960906\" width=620 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113450/extras/bc22986647692bfc13ddd7184a8ecbc4.webm?t=1765960906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113450/extras/bc22986647692bfc13ddd7184a8ecbc4.mp4?t=1765960906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Freedom &amp; Glory</strong> aims to combine adventure, multiple choices, and historical storytelling: <br><i>Rather than following a textbook script, Freedom &amp; Glory presents history as a dynamic, branching experience.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player takes on the role of a ship captain navigating through decisive historical moments, managing both crew and moral choices.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Mechanics &amp; Content</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative choices</strong>: multiple paths available depending on the player\u2019s decisions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quests and progression</strong>: version 0.1.4, as mentioned by the developers, includes <i>10\u201315 minutes of gameplay, 6 quests, and 3 secondary characters. A three-part story with multiple possible paths.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong>: auto-save system, customization (character/ship name), improved tutorial are listed in version 0.1.5.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Development state</strong>: the historical context and environment (ship, island, crew) are still under visual/technical development.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udccc Positioning &amp; Ambition</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game positions itself as <i>\u201ca unique interactive experience that blends: a deep narrative RPG where every dialogue and choice impacts your \u2026\u201d</i> according to its Ulule page.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The studio indicates its intention to go beyond traditional <i>\u201cedutainment\u201d</i>: a game that not only informs but truly immerses players in history.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2705 Strengths</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>rich narrative</strong> and <strong>multiple branching choices</strong> provide strong replayability (different paths depending on decisions).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>historical theme</strong> is quite rare in indie narrative games, which makes it stand out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Being developed by a <strong>French independent studio (Pillow Interactive)</strong> adds a handcrafted, authentic dimension.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Pillow Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113450/0670da2c97246365e3994bf8b0f75a1b13f31296/header.jpg?t=1765960906","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Fran\u00e7ais :<br />\r\n\u00a9 2025 Pillow Interactive. Tous droits r\u00e9serv\u00e9s.<br />\r\nLe nom du jeu et le logo Pillow Interactive sont des marques d\u00e9pos\u00e9es de Pillow Interactive.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEnglish :<br />\r\n\u00a9 2025 Pillow Interactive. All rights reserved.<br />\r\nThe game title and Pillow Interactive logo are trademarks of Pillow Interactive.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4113450/935382561/24caafba393949ed54551323c39cbbd929d7eccf/1762178815/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762182386","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4113450/935382561/24caafba393949ed54551323c39cbbd929d7eccf/1762178815/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762182386","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.ste